Step by step guide for Lubuntu-26.04.

A fresh install of Lubuntu-26.04.
Select your preferences. I picked normal installation as it was installed on my desktop PC. Laptops may vary.
After the installation:
Menu
Preferences
Additional Drivers
Then you need to change the X.Org X server to NVIDIA driver metapackage from nvidia-driver-595(proprietary). Note the drivers will be updated in time so later on
driver version will change. I wouldn't advice do it manually. Way too long and poitnless unless someone wants to learn how it can be done manually. 
Apply changes
Restart. 

This should sort the drivers.
